# Results

Observed outputs and runtime findings associated with the ASRO × NeoMundi LegalTech study.

This directory may contain:
- provider comparison outputs,
- runtime behavioral findings,
- FLAG event observations,
- continuity vs divergence analyses,
- hallucination observations,
- coherence measurements,
- regime classifications,
- cross-provider comparison summaries.

These results are considered experimental observations and may evolve during review and validation phases.
